  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "ふしぎな　ちからで　テレポートして\nじぶんと　みかたの　いばしょを\nいれかえる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "이상한 힘으로 순간이동하여\n자신과 같은 편의 위치를\n바꾼다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "用神奇的力量瞬間移動，\n讓自己和同伴的所在位置互換。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Le lanceur se téléporte à l’aide d’un pouvoir mystérieux.\nIl échange sa place avec celle d’un allié sur le terrain.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Wundersame Kräfte teleportieren den Anwender an\nden Platz eines Mitstreiters.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Extraño poder que intercambia la posición del usuario\ncon la de un aliado sobre el terreno de combate.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Chi la usa cambia di posto con un alleato\nin campo grazie a un misterioso potere.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user teleports using a strange power and\nswitches places with one of its allies.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "不思議な　力で　テレポートして\n自分と　味方の　居場所を\n入れ替える。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "用神奇的力量瞬间移动，\n互换自己和同伴所在的位置。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Extraño poder que intercambia la posición del usuario\ncon la de un aliado sobre el terreno de combate.",
